flowchart TD
    %% XAI (SHAP) Explanation Generation Flow - Simplified
    
    Start([User Requests Explanation]) --> Load["Load Model & Data<br/>career_model.pkl<br/>Background dataset"]
    
    Load --> Compute["Compute SHAP Values<br/>TreeExplainer / KernelExplainer<br/>Calculate feature contributions"]
    
    Compute --> Rank["Rank Features<br/>Sort by importance<br/>Identify top 10"]
    
    Rank --> Visualize["Generate Visualization<br/>SHAP force plot<br/>Save to backend/static/"]
    
    Visualize --> Explain["Natural Language Explanation<br/>Convert SHAP to readable text<br/>Calculate confidence level"]
    
    Explain --> Counterfactual{User wants<br/>what-if analysis?}
    
    Counterfactual -->|Yes| WhatIf["Generate Suggestions<br/>What to change<br/>Priority ranking"]
    Counterfactual -->|No| Format
    
    WhatIf --> Format["Format Response<br/>SHAP values, plot, insights"]
    
    Format --> End([Return XAI Response])
    
    style Start fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#22c55e,stroke-width:3px
    style Input fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#3b82f6,stroke-width:2px
